[agent:result] stdout: The Lakeflow Spark Declarative Pipelines API allows you to create, edit,
[agent:result]   delete, start, and view details about pipelines.
[agent:result] 
[agent:result]   Spark Declarative Pipelines is a framework for building reliable,
[agent:result]   maintainable, and testable data processing pipelines. You define the
[agent:result]   transformations to perform on your data, and Spark Declarative Pipelines
[agent:result]   manages task orchestration, cluster management, monitoring, data quality, and
[agent:result]   error handling.
[agent:result] 
[agent:result]   Instead of defining your data pipelines using a series of separate Apache
[agent:result]   Spark tasks, Spark Declarative Pipelines manages how your data is transformed
[agent:result]   based on a target schema you define for each processing step. You can also
[agent:result]   enforce data quality with Spark Declarative Pipelines expectations.
